62,3,1,talk,George,,"@Asuka, the riders said they would pay to avoid equal claims. Option A respects that preference. I am voting A.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,"@George, the neighbouring block’s secretary said charges made people stop showing up. Option A turns neighbours into debtors. I reject it.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
