65,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Mio, Option B eliminates the shifting hazard and rain damage by removing fixed spots. It is the only option that addresses the physical reality without adding administrative burden.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
