67,3,2,talk,George,,"@Ryuji, the ledger is important, but the five-year stagnation is the real failure. Option B breaks that cycle. I am voting B.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Ryuji, capital work is a one-time cost. Option A’s monthly charges are a permanent relationship killer. The neighbouring block proved it. I reject A.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
