74,3,3,talk,Mio,,"@Shunichi, I agree! Option B stops the shifting mess. But who checks the racks? I’m voting B, but we need a simple, visible way to keep the work from vanishing!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
