77,3,4,talk,George,,"@Mio, the five-year stagnation is the real failure. Option B breaks that cycle. I am voting B.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Shunichi,,"@Mio, Option B is the only choice that keeps us nodding in the lobby instead of timing our exits. I am voting B.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
